    <briefdescription>
<para>Configuration for a coordinated multi-node update session. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Constraints (from module ROADMAP):<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1updates_1_1_hot_reload_engine" kindref="compound">HotReloadEngine</ref> is used for the actual file-level update on each node; callers must not run concurrent updates.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Actual inter-node transport (wait/signal) is injected via callbacks so that this class remains transport-agnostic and fully unit-testable. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
